<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">MFLP-OMUSEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">Mafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliñolo lya Paulusi ku MaFilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mafil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulusi nakun̄ola elin̄olo eli kwa sikulumela mu Filipi emyaka no kukwana makumi mutanu ni likumi ni kamweya (61AD) munyima no kufa kwa Jesu. Kama ana kulin̄ola abo yoli mu tolongo (1:13), Mwendi neli mu Loma. Elin̄olo kama lina kun̄olelwa ku Keleke ili mu mulenen̄i wa Filipi. Kama tu twesa okwiyeta kanyonyo eya Filipi mu buka no Tikezo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Filipi neli mulenen̄i munene mutolopo mu Mesodoniya. Eyi neli kame ekeleke no matatekelo eyo ina kutendiwa mu Mesidoniya. Paulusi ni Sailasi kame ana kutateka ekeleke eyi bamweya mane kame ana kubekiwa mutolongo usiku umweya aba ana kwikalanga kuya (Etikezo 16).</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulusi kama afanena okwikala ni mabaka no kupula ao ana kulita nji an̄ole elin̄olo eli. Kame anokutusisa eyi taba okutumela ku keleke ku mpo eyo ana kutuma kwa yonyene aba ana kuyupa nji kama ali mu tolongo (4.10-19). Kame ana kwa limukisa kame omukwa anakwikalanga nawo mu tolongo mane sebeli oyuleka Timoteya ni Epafuloditasi ku Keleke (2.19-30) nji aatambule mane akuteke eketelelo yoo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no titaba.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulusi kama atateka elin̄olo mumukwa no kulumelisa Ekeleke mu Flipi (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io2">Esisitatama ko, kama akutabela noo elin̄usa eli no mwikalelo waye mane ni mihupulo eyo ali nayo (1.3-2:30)</para>
  <para style="io3">Cwale kama aba eti taelo eti titendahala ku kuyoya no alumeli (3.1-4; 9) Paulusi kame amana elin̄olo laye mu mukwa no kutumela ku Keleke no Mafilipi ku mpo yoo mane ni kutuma etitumeliso (4.10-23).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa mene Paulusi ni Timoteya abika a Kilesite Jesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Kwa asikupumena onje mwa Kilesite Jesu awo ali ku Mafilipi nabika na asikwatusa.<verse eid="PHP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Mubiwe esishemo ni kozo itunda kwa Nyambe Sitetu ni kwa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etapelo ya Paulusi ku Keleke namu Mafilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Kame ni kutumbelanga kwa Nyambe wange munako yonje abani mipulukanga. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Enako yonje mu tapelo yange mulibaka lyenu monje kame ni milapelela mukuwabelwa, <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>oukutumela mu kubelekela bamweya mu liywi no kuwaba okutunda ba liywaa no weli okulita ba liywaa lya balelo. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Mi kame ni pumena nji woyo onakutateka omusebezi no kuwaba mwaanyi, mbaumanenene ba liywaa lya Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Kame nifanena nji niyupe ngeso mwaanyi monje! Kakuli kame muli mu mucima wange kakuli kame mukutabela esishemo ni mene bamweya mukunungiwa kwange mu tolongo ni muukusileleza ni mukoongoteta eliywi. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Kakuli Nyambe yo paki wange omo nina minyolelelwe monje ni lilato lya Kilesite Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Mi etapelo yange ninji elilato lyenu liekezehe onene, ni zibo ni kuyupisisa konje kwenu, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>nji cwale mulemuhe eso no kuwaba ni kukena nikuulwa okunyaziwa ba liywaa lya Kilesite, <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>memwiyalile emiselo no kuluka eyo iiya mulibaka lya Jesu Kilesite ku kanya ni milumbeko kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyoya ni Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Abaange kame nisinga nji mulimuke nji eso sina tendahala kwa mene nasitusu luli okutwala eliywi no kuwaba kuuso. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Nji cwale nakulimukiwa kwaatateleli no mulenen̄i ni kwanjili onje nji okunungiwa kwange nimulibaka lya Kilesite. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Mi abetu anjili naaku kolwisisa mwa Mbumu mulibaka no kunugiwa kwange mane kame ali ni undume onene mu kwamba eliywi lya Nyambe mukwacila.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Anjili luli kame akutaza Kilesiite mu muna ni mutin̄ananyi, kono anjili kame akutaza mukusinga no kuwaba. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Aano mamaneneno kame atenda mu lilato, kame ayii nji kame ni na bekiwa ba musebezi no kusileleza eliywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Kono ano matatekelo kame kutaza Kilesite mu kwakununga nimu kwasepahala kono mukunahana nji anekeleze ku utata mu tolongo.<verse eid="PHP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Iikene cwale! konji fela mundila yonje simba eyi no ukulyanganisa, simba mu niti, Kilesite kame akutaziwa mane mweso kame ni wabelwe, <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>ee mane kame sani wabelelwe kakuli kame niyii nji mu titapelo tenu ni kutuso no Mebo ya Jesu Kilesite eyi mbani lukululwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Kanyi aba ni nyolelwe ni kutatelele onene ni kusepa nji kanitamba okweene, kono mukususuweziwa bano kanyi mu nako yonje Kilesite mba kutekiwa mu lutu lwange, simba mu kuyoya kwange, simba mu lifu lyange. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Kakuli mwa mene oku yoya ni Kilesite mi okufa ni kutulo. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Nji okuyoya nimu lutu mba ni uyu embuya no musebezi wange, cwale sibine sani kete kanitwese okwamba. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Kakuli kame nileminwe kwiinu yiili. Etakazo yange kame nisinga okuta nukekala ni Kilesite, mi sokame esi no kuwaba onene. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Kono okwikala mu lutu, mba ku tende wino mulibaka lyenu. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Kame nipumena mwesi, kame niyii nji mba niikala ni kutwalelela naanyi monje mulibaka no kwekeza kwenu ni kuwabelelwa mu tumelo, <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>nji cwale mwa mene muwane elibaka ku kanya mwa Kilesite Jesu kakuli kame saniiye kwaanyi kame.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Cwale esi no utokwa ninji omukwa no moyo wenu otenda no liywi no kuwaba lya Kilesite, nji cwale simba naba niiya mukumi mona simba sisako, kame nifanena okuyupe yenu nji kame mwimanine mukoongola mu mebo imweya, mane ni muhupulo umweya me mulwela bamweya ku maneku onje mulibaka no tumelo no liywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Cwale mulese okuciliswa mu sinu sonje mulibaka no ila yenu, kwa onyene esi nisisupo esi silimukiwa no ku sinyeha koo, kono kwaanyi nisisupo no kuyoyisiwa kwenu, mi eso kame situnda kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Kakuli kame sina biwi kwaanyi mulibaka lya Kilesite nji mulese okupumena fela mwa yonyene kono nikuyanda ngeso mulibaka lyaye, <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>me muli mu mayando amweya awo muna mono neyi mu yupa nji kwesili kwa mene.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Owikokobezo ni Kuneneba kwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Cwale nji kame kuli esusuwezo injili mwa Kilesite aba kuli neyi ikwisa omucima mu lilato, aba kuli nu ukuwana mu Mebo, aba kuli ni makeke ni kuyupela okukola, <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>cwale mu manenene okuwabelelwa kwange mulibaka no Mebo imweya ni lilato limweya ni munahano umweya. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Mulese oku tende esinjili ni tin̄ananyi, simba oku babaza no fela, kono mu ukukokobeza omunu ni munu a yambute nji anjili kame a mu bita. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Omunu alese oku tokomele eyaye fela, kono alikete neyi ya kwaye. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Mwikale ni mwikalelo owo ana kwikalako ni kwa Kilesite Jesu,<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>anyine simba ngeso ona kwikala mu sumbiwa sa Nyambe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">kasikukubala nji kame akukumanena ni Nyambe ni sinu esi sa lemenene.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Kono sebeli okutenda yonyene okwikala omubika, ni kuleiwa mukufeka kanyi aanu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>Mi na waniwa yoli kanyi munu, yo kukokobeza, sebeli okubeeka okuyupa okutwala ku lifu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">mane elifu na ba sifapano.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Mulibakelyo Nyambe kame ana mu tuleke onene ni ku bitelela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">mi kame ana mubi elitina eli li li beulu no matina onje,<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>nji cwale mu litina lya Jesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">amanwi onje a kubame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">ku liwilu ni mu litunga ni munji no litunga,<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>mi amalimi onje aambe nji Jesu Kilesite ni Mbumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">ku kanya ya Nyambe Sitange.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okubenya kanyi Amasebeli mu Litunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Cwalehe asingiwa ange, kanyi aba munikuteka enako yonje cwale bano kasa fela aba niliko kono onene luli nabo kani sako. Musebeze eyi no ku yoyisiwa kwenu mu kucila ni mukunjanjata, <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>kakuli Nyambe kame asebeza mwaanyi bamweya ku kusinga ni kukusebeza mulibaka no kusinga kwaye no kuwaba.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Mu tende einu yonje mu kwatonga simba oku kanana, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>nji cwale mutende ano kwa nyazahala ni kuulwa ouyi, aana a Nyambe aa aulwile esi si nyazahala mukaci no lusika no kwaluka ni kwiiba, omo kame mu benya kanyi amasebeli mu litunga, <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>me mu ongotite eliywi no moyo. nji cwale mu liywaa lya Kilesite kame sa ni kuyeeme nji kanisi ituka fela, ni ku sebeza feela.<verse eid="PHP 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Simba nji kame nina kwitekiwa kanyi esitabelo no sino ba sitabelo no tumelo yenu, kame ni wabelwa ni kuwabelelwa naanyi moonje. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Mundila imweya naanyi kame mufanena okuwabelwa ni kuwabelelwa ni mene ngeso.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Timoteya ni Epafuladitusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Kame nili ni sepo mwa Mbumu Jesu nji kame sani mitumene Timoteya abano, nji cwale ni susuweziwe mulibaka no kuyupa eyenu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Kani kwite omunu okufekile kanyi yonyene woyo so ikala nuukukalelwa mulibaka no kuyoya kwenu. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Onje kame aku saelela eyoo eyo asinga, kasa eyo ya Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Kono kame muyii okusepahala kwa Timoteya omo kanyi omwana ni sitaye kame ana kusebeza ni mene mu liywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Cwalehe kame ni sepa okumutuma abano kanyi omo ni monene eyo saitendahale kwa mene. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Kame ni sepile mwa Mbumu nji menyene mbaniiyi mu wangu ngeso.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Kame nina kunahana nji kwautokwa okutumena Epafaloditusi mwabange woyo ni sebeza naye, omusole ni mutumiwa wenu ni mutusi kweyi nisaela. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Kakuli kame ana minyolelwe monje, kame muna ku ziyeleha onene aba muna kuyupa nji kame ana kutoma. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Niti luli kame ana kutoma mane kame ana singi okufa. Kono Nyambe kame ana mu yupele amakeke kasa yonyene fela kono ni mene ngeso, kambe kame nina kwiyelwa amaswabi no kwekeza ba maswabi. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Kame nili ni nyolelo no kumutuma, cwalehe nji mu wabelelwe ba kumumona kame mane kame sani bilaele mbicani. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Cwale mu mutambule mwa Mbumu, mu kuwabelwa konje mane nikukuteka aanu no ngeso, <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>kakuli kame ana kusinga okufa mulibaka no musebezi wa Kilesite, kame ana kutoboha omoyo waye nji atende esi muna kukwangwa okuni tendela.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Okuluka no Niti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Okumanenena, abaange, mu wabelelwe mwa Mbumu. Okumin̄olela esinu simweya kanibilaele, mi mwaanyi kame siikalile wino. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Mutunde kwaanu awo asebeza eyi no kwiiba, awo aambwa mu tunde kwawo apatula olutu. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Kakuli aaci asimupato no niti, awo alapela Nyambe mu Mebo ni kanya mwa Kilesite Jesu mi katu sepe eyi nounu. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Simba nji mene menyene kame nili ni libaka no kusepa nounu ngeso. Nji omunu munjili kame anahana nji kame ali ni libaka ba kusepa eyi nounu, mene kame nibitelela. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Kame ni na kwingena mu mupato ba liywaa no atanu ni twaatu (8), no aanu no Isilaele, no mushobo wa Benjamine, kame nili omuhebelu onaleiwa ku Mahebelu, kweyi no mulawo kame nili omufalisi. <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>Kweyi no ku tukufalelwa time nina yandisa Endoo ya Nyambe. Kweyi no kuluka munji no mulawo kakwisa esi ni nyazahale naso. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Kono eso sonje eso sekeza kweso nikwite kame ni baliwa kanyi okusinyehelwa mulibaka lya Kilesite. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Niti luli kame nibala einu yonje kanyi esinyehelo mulibaka no utokwa no kuneneba ni kubitelela ou no kulimuka Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wange. Kakuli mulibaka lyaye kame nina yanda okusinyehelwa einu yonje, mane okwibala kanyi eyi ikaninwe nji cwale nifume Kilesite, <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>mi kame ni na waniwa mwa yonyene me kanikwite okuluka kwange menyene ou wimanine ba mulawo, kono mu kupumena mwa Kilesite, okuluka kutunda kwa Nyambe ou wimanine ba tumelo. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Nji nilimuke Kilesite ni maata no kwinguka kwaye, nu ukutabela amayando aye, mane ni feke kanyi yonyene mu lifu lyaye, <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>nji cwale kutwesahale nika inguke kwaafu.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okwituka okuta ku Sikonkwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Kasa nji na wanakale omupuzo ou simba nji napetahala kale. Kono kame ni twalelelela menyene kakuli Kilesite Jesu kame ana nitende waye. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Abaange, kani puluka nji na lema kale menyene, kono esinu simweya nitenda, kame ni pulama eyi ili munyima mi kame ni koongota kweyi ili kulubala. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Kame ni itukela ba sikonkwani mulibaka no mupuzo no kwisaniwa kunene kwa Nyambe mwa Kilesite Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Aci tonje tunakulu mu tingana kame tufanena okwikala ni mukwa mumweya ou. Mi nji mu sinu sonje kamu lumelelana, Nyambe mba mi monisa esi sifanena. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Konji mutulesele tuleme eniti kweso tuna wana.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Abaange mukuwane mu kunifaniketa, mi mutwale emicima yenu kwawo ayoya kanyi kame muli omwanda mwaaci. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Kakuli anokupula awo nina myambele mane nibano nisi myambela ni myooti, muyoye kanyi eila no sifapano sa Kilesite. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Okubwa koo niku sinyeha, Nyambe woo ni lipumo, mi kame akuyeema mukweena koo mane nimihupulo iimanine ba inu no litunga feela. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Kono aci owikalo wetu kame uli mu wilu, mi bawonyene kame tutatelele omuyoyisi Ombumu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Woyo so futula etinyutu tetu eti tifa nji tukufeke ni lutu lwaye no kanya mulibaka no maata awo amutwesisa simba okubeeka einu yonje kwa yonyene.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s">Etitaelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Cwalehe abaange, awo ni singa ni kunyolelwa onene, aanyi okuwabelwa kwange ni mushukwe wange mwimane mukoongola mwa Mbumu asingiwa ange. <verse eid="PHP 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Kame ni kumbela Eudiya ni Sintike nji akuyupe mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Mi kame ni mikumbela ngeso, abeleki no niti mutuse aa akati kakauli kame ana sebeze oku noku ni mene mu liywi bamweya ni Kilementi na tusi anjili, awo amatina oo kame ali mu buka no moyo.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Muwabelelwe mwa Mbumu enako yonje kame niukela okwamba nji muwabelelwe.<verse eid="PHP 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Mulesele aanu onje alimuke omusa wenu. Ombumu kame ali beebi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Mulese oku bilaela ku sinjili, kono musinu sonje mu lapele ni ku kumbela owitumelo mi okukumbela kwenu ku limukiwe kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Cwale ekozo ya Nyambe eyi ibita oku yupisisa konje, mba iteula emicima yenu ni mihupulo yenu mwa Kilesite Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Amamaneneno abaange, esinu sonje esi no niti, sonje esi sikutekiwa, sonje esi no kuluka, sonje esi no kukena, sonje esi sisingiwa, sonje esi sishemo, nesi silukile okuyemiwa, nji kame kuli esinjili eso sifanena kuyeema, mupuluke einu eyi. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Eyi muna iyetiwa kwa mene ni kutambula ni kuyupa neyi muna mono mwa mene, mwitende mi Nyambe no kozo mba ikala naanyi.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oukutumela ku Timpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Kame ni wabelelwa onene mwa Mbumu nji cwale munyima no nako nokuleba na muwana ekolo no kumonisa nji kame munipuluka luli kame muna kuni hupuanga, kono kamusikuwana esibaka. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Kasa nji kame ni bilaela ku sinjili kakuli kame nina kwiyete mu mukwa onje owo niyupisisa kame ni fanena. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Kame niyii oku yoya mu kusheba, mi kame niyii oku yoya mu kupulelwa einu. Mu inu yonje kame nina kwiyete oku yoya mu kwikuta simba mu kuyomba, okupulelwa simba okuulwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Kame nitwesa okutenda einu yonje mwa Kilesite woyo onongota.<verse eid="PHP 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Nabakulingeso na mutende wino okutabela ku mayando ange. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Cwale aanyi Amafilipi mwenyene kame muyii nji ku matatekelo no liywi no kuwaba, aba nina kutunda ku Mesodonia kakwisa Endoo ya Nyambe ina kukuwana ni mene mukuba nimu kutambula konji aanyi feela. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Simba mu Teselonika, kame muna kunitusa okubitelela kamweya. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Kasanji kame ni saela empo, kono kame ni saela Omuselo owo ubekiwa kwaanyi mu kupula. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Kame ina tambula etuwelo no kwiyala ni kubitelela, mane kame niiyalile aba nina tambula kwa Epafuladitusi empo muna kutuma enubu no mumwee noku mamata, esitabelo esi sitambulwa ni kuwabelisa kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Mi Nyambe wange mba mi monene kweyi mu saela yonje, okuta kufumu waye mu kanya mwa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Kwa Nyambe ni Sitetu kwikale ekanya mu nako ni nako. Ameni<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulaano no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Mu keete aasikupumena onje aa ali mwa Kilesite Jesu. Abange aa nili noo kame ami keeta. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Aasikupumena onje kame ami keeta, onene aa sindoo ya Sesale.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Esishemo sa Mbumu Kilesite Jesu siikale ni mebo yenu. Ameni!<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
